    <guid isPermaLink="false">68dead3c8bf86095c59d7b78</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Oct 2025 17:38:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，也是</span><strong><span>主题“小矮人”</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>第二篇</span></strong><span>内容，讲一讲</span><strong><span>黑森林的传说</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑森林里不仅到处是挺拔的冷杉树，在森林的最深处，一颗最高大的冷杉树后，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还藏着一个身穿黑色短衣，脚踩红色小袜子，头戴小帽子的</span><strong><span>小玻璃人</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小玻璃人不仅是黑森林的</span><strong><span>守宝人</span></strong><span>，更是位</span><strong><span>许愿精灵</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小玻璃人从不轻易现身，谁要是有幸见到了他，就可以许下</span><strong><span>三个愿望</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*/时间线/*</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 引语：黑森林，冷杉树和小玻璃人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:00:55</a> 冷酷的心，烧炭工彼得蒙克和他的三个愿望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4569">01:16:09</a> &nbsp;结语：浪子回头金不换？妻子不是丈夫的赎罪卷。</span></p>]]></description>
