    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目，也是</span><strong><span>主题“草木生灵”</span></strong><span>的第二篇内容，从</span><strong><span>青蛙的故事</span></strong><span>开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与以往不同的是，我会带来</span><strong><span>王子和公主</span></strong><span>两个版本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前者</span><strong><span>青蛙王子</span></strong><span>，早早就成为了童话界的顶流；而后者</span><strong><span>青蛙公主</span></strong><span>，却至今默默无闻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么同样都是青蛙，王子和公主的待遇会天差地别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>两篇大相径庭的故事背后，又是否存在着共同之处呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>*/时间线/*</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 引语：公主王子，同蛙不同命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:00:55</a> 青蛙公主（王子娶了一只青蛙）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">00:08:42</a> 青蛙王子（青蛙国王）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">00:17:56</a> 结语：以缺陷为始 以婚姻为终，两种结局改编</span></p>]]></description>
